														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2078841">
									

<p>You know what. I like this. It's not overly dramatic, it doesn't try to be something overwhelming, the influence is subtle, and it's well written. All of these things are plenty to warrant a +1 from me.</p>
<p>A minor pick, though.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Same-sex marriage legislation was voted upon in New York seven days after the incident. ██% of people voted in favor of its legalization, compared to only █% negative votes.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>No real need to blackbox that, since that was a real event and the numbers are public.</p>

