			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2078857">
									

<p>33/62 (~53%) NY State Senators voted in favor of the bill; a 2011 public opinion found that 58% of NY voters were in favor of same-sex marriage. Those numbers are <em>slightly</em> lower than what I'd personally think a mind-affecting SCP could achieve. If the blackboxes break anyone else's suspension of disbelief, I'll omit them and just be a little bit more general.</p>
<p>Thank you for the upvote though!</p>

