			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2079134">
									

<p>Those numbers are <em>exactly</em> what I'd want/expect from a mind-affecting SCP. Like I complain about a lot, the thing I hate most is when SCPs go the route of &quot;affecting everyone's minds equally&quot; because people aren't all the same, mentally, and theoretically a mind trick that could turn someone's opinion one way could have another person develop an irrational hatred for something completely different.</p>
<p>Also</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-2866 produced a sign that read &quot;FUCK THE FOUNDATION.&quot;</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Ey, fuck you buddy &gt;=O</p>

